    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d559">

                <pb facs="0694" n="592" xml:id="pg592"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/631: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in China</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Reinsch</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-01-20T22:00:00+08:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 20,
                                1919, 10 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[<hi rendition="#italic">Received
                            January 21, 6.16 a.m.</hi>]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Is it your desire that I should inform the Chinese Government of the terms of the
                    agreement concerning Siberian and Chinese Eastern Railway[s]? How will the
                    invitation to appoint a member on the railway commission be conveyed to the
                    Chinese Government? The Chinese have informally asked for information.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Reinsch</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
